                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 20pt;line-height: 29.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全校教工：根据上级文件精神，组织开展我校“县管校聘”工作。我校工作方案（征求意见稿）请老师们知晓，如有意见建议请大家在7月7日中午前发党政办朱垭烨老师汇总。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 20pt;line-height: 29.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 20pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴市第一中学</strong></span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 20pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2025年</strong></span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 20pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“县管校聘”实施方案</strong></span></p><h1 style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 29.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（征求意见稿）</span></h1><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为进一步深化教师队伍管理体制改革，促进师资均衡配置，增强教师队伍活力，根据《绍兴市教育局关于印发<继续深化市直学校教师“县管校聘”管理改革的实施方案>的通知》（绍市教〔2025〕29号）和《关于进一步完善中小学校专业技术岗位设置管理的通知》（绍市人社发〔2019〕75号）等文件精神，在2021年实施基础上，结合我校实际，特制定本实施方案</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、学校基本情况 </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校核定编制2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，截止202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年6月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">30</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日共有</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在编教职工</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">201</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">名</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（含</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2025年下半年退休2人，非</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">科任教师</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，绍兴市高级中学借编</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2025学年预设</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班级51个（含下学期</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">素养班</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、竞聘基本原则</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持按需设岗、竞聘上岗、按岗聘用的原则；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持以德为先、能力为重、注重实绩的原则；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持公开、公平、择优的原则。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、竞聘基本条件</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1．遵守国家法律和学校各项规章制度，具有良好师德师风；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">身心健康，能坚持正常工作；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">热爱学校，服从学校的工作安排和调配，愿意承担满工作量和适当的超工作量；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师应具有相应教师资格证，职工应具有相应从业资格证。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四、竞聘范围及对象</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直公办学校除校领导（含保留待遇）外的所有在编在岗教职工。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五、竞聘程序</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组建机构</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校成立“县管校聘”工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作领导小组，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下设竞聘工作小组、人事争议仲裁小组和监督小组。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞聘工作小组负责本校岗位竞聘的组织实施工作</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人事争议仲裁小组负责本校教职工意见的收集、反映，并对竞聘过程中出现的矛盾和纠纷进行调解</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">监督小组负责对本校“县管校聘”工作全过程各环节的公开透明、公平公正情况进行全面监督，及时准确提出监督意见</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。具体人员组成为：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.“县管校聘”工作领导小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">丁初效</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>副</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋  明</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞奇弘、杨佩琼、朱水军、冯王亮、陈  锋</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞聘工作小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋  明</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞奇弘、杨佩琼、朱水军、冯王亮、陈  锋、刘明玉、祝智浩、杨大为、朱垭烨、许琪玫</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.人事争议仲裁小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱水军</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金  笛、赵正瑜、马丹娜、何隽豪</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.监督小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杨佩琼</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">张  江、陈微微</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）宣传动员</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校组织召开各个层面的会议。认真学习相关文件精神，宣讲和解读有关政策，使上级部门政策规定、学校实施方案等知晓率达100%，岗位政策人人知晓。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（三）岗位申请</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">所有在编在岗人员</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（除校级领导）需</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按学校公布的聘任方案要求、岗位设置、岗位条件，向学校提交书面申请</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">:申请</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校内竞聘（含直接聘用）的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教工需填写《绍兴市第一中学教职工竞聘（直聘）申报表》（见附件</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">），其中以“近三年内即将退休”条件申请直接聘用的，还需填写《</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">退休三年内直聘教师按时退休承诺书</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">》（见附件</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">申请跨校竞聘的教工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">需填写《</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市直学校教职工竞聘（直聘）申报表</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">》（见附件</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">），</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人数一般不超过本校在编教工总数的5%。无特殊原因在规定时间内不提交个人申请的，视作自动放弃竞聘资格</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校有权按拒聘或落聘情况处理。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校竞聘工作小组</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师个人申请竞岗</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">情况，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">结合处室岗位和学科岗位设置情况以及跨校竞聘教师等情况，进行双向选择，讨论研究确定各处室岗位和学科教师的首轮拟聘名单，拟聘教师自然聘任为相应的学科教师。跨校竞聘结果需由双方学校协商决定。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（四）各层面“工作岗位”的竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> 1．直接聘用</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">符合市教育局文件规定的以下五类直聘对象，经个人申请，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校竞聘工作小组</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">审核确认后，可直接续聘相应岗位。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五类直聘对象如下：①经组织选派正在援派（挂职）期间的教师；②处于孕期和哺乳期的教师；③患重大疾病的教师；④经市教育局同意外派的教师；⑤近三年内即将退休人员（根据2025年1月1日起实施的《国务院关于渐进式延迟法定退休年龄的办法》规定，按改革后法定退休年龄计算，截至2028年8月31日前退休的人员）。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经组织选派正在援派（挂职）期间的教师，以及经市教育局同意外派等在编不在岗的教师，其所用编制、岗位由市教育局统筹解决。统筹的编制、岗位不得移作他用。若本人申请参加高一级岗位竞聘上岗的，则其直聘资格和岗位不再保留。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">关于孕期哺乳期人员：女职工孕期须提供县级及以上医院出具的诊断证明和有关诊断材料；哺乳期应为12个月，指从婴儿出生之日起计满12个月。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">关于重病人员：重病人员指患有现医疗条件下短时间内难以治愈的，一般按规定程序须连续请假6个月及以上且仍在治疗期的人员。重病人员须提供县级及以上医院出具的诊断证明、原始病历、病假期间的所有配药单据、发票等材料。重病人员须在校内公示5个工作日，无异议后确定。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2．首轮竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">首轮竞聘按以下三类人员依次竞聘，确认后统一公示。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（1）学校行政管理人员</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>科任岗位</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞聘对象：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">原</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中层副职及以上、群团干部、年级长、支部书记及教研组组长。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞岗原则：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自愿申报与竞聘工作小组综合分析评价相结合。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞岗流程</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">①科任岗位及岗位设置数如下：</span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0.53in;" class="firstRow"><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 31.55pt;"><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党政办</span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 30.55pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 