an></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 99pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 0.15in;"><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 54pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 108pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 108pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 99pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 0.15in;"><td colspan="2" style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 162pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">合计</span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 108pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">13.5</span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 99pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">13.5</span></p></td><td style="background: #FFFFFF;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 99pt;">
</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>注：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">0.5</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”指兼学科教学折算。现有在岗人员之前已直聘或聘任为科任教师，则自然续聘为工勤教辅岗位人员；实际工勤教辅“现有岗位人数和设置岗位数”，以科任教师聘任后统计结果为准。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">②根据之前教工个人书面申请，学校根据教工个人申请竞岗情况，结合岗位设置要求和具体岗位的实际情况，由竞聘工作小组讨论研究形成拟聘名单。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本校教师首轮竞聘和跨校竞聘教工结果，由学校“县管校聘”工作领导小组讨论确定，拟聘名单经公示无异议后，报市教育局备案。 </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.二轮竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校内首轮落聘人员按规定时间参加市教育局统筹二轮竞聘。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）公布岗位：市教育局汇总并公布各校岗位空缺情况；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）填报志愿：首轮未聘的人员，按公布的空缺岗位、任职条件向空岗学校填报递交竞聘岗位志愿，填报志愿只能报一所学校，但可以填报一所学校多个岗位或服从分配；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）组织竞聘：根据岗位要求，聘用学校自主确定竞聘方式，择优聘用竞聘人员；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）公布结果：宣布竞聘结果。竞聘结果须经聘用学校公示并报市教育局备案。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为确保学校总体队伍稳定有序，顺利开展学校下一学年度教学管理，学校流入、流出的总人数下限为</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">100人以内1人、100人以上为1.5%（四舍五入）、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上限比例为5%</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（四舍五入）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。超出上限，聘任情况需报市教育局审批同意。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组织调剂</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对经过二轮竞聘仍未上岗的校内教工，市教育局根据各校岗位实际情况进行统筹调剂，安排相应工作岗位。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>待岗培训</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对没有参加竞聘或竞聘未上岗又不服从组织统筹调剂的人员，原则上在学校待岗培训。待岗培训时间不超过12个月；待岗培训期内，只发放基本工资和不超过50%的基础性绩效工资，不享受奖励性绩效工资。待岗培训当年年度考核不能评为合格及以上等次。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）办理手续</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各类聘用人员在聘用学校公示5个工作日，学校要做到广大教职工广泛知晓，公示期满无异议的，按规定办理人事调动手续和事业单位岗位聘用手续。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聘期内学校有空缺岗位的，可有计划地开展补缺聘任，其聘期与学校整体聘任周期保持一致。低聘或转岗的教师，按照“以岗定薪、岗变薪变”的原则，按新聘岗位确定工资待遇。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>六.其他事宜</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对已竞聘上岗人员可根据学校工作需要综合协调，统筹安排，确定其具体工作岗位，校内转岗由学校统筹安排，报教育局备案；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2．教职工如对岗位竞聘有异议，由学校人事争议仲裁小组处理；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3．未按时申报和参加竞岗的视为自动放弃；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4．所有结果都须公示，所有纸质材料封存备查；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5．监督小组全程监督本方案的执行；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6．本方案在广泛征求全校教职工意见和建议的基础上，经教代会通过后，报教育局审批同意后即予以实行。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7．本方案解释权归“县管校聘”工作领导小组所有。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市第一中学</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">202</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0.33in;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>附件：</stron